    "description": "<p>Make your travel stress-free with our <strong>Personalized Luggage Tag</strong>, designed to keep your bags easily identifiable and secure. Whether you're travelling through airports, sending kids to school, or carrying office backpacks, this durable ID tag ensures your belongings always find their way back to you.</p><p>Crafted with <strong>high-quality, long-lasting material</strong>, the tag features a <strong>bold, easy-to-read print</strong> with your <strong>Name, Class, Phone Number, or any custom text</strong>. The strong strap keeps it firmly attached to suitcases, duffel bags, school bags, laptop bags, and trolleys.</p><p>Perfect for <strong>kids, students, frequent travelers, doctors, corporate professionals, and families</strong>, this tag adds both <strong>safety and style</strong> to your luggage.</p><p>✔ <strong>Fully customizable</strong> (Name, Class, Mobile Number, etc.)</p><p>✔ <strong>Durable &amp; waterproof</strong> material</p><p>✔ <strong>Bright colors for easy visibility</strong></p><p>✔ <strong>Strong strap</strong> for secure attachment</p><p>✔ Ideal for <strong>travel bags, office bags, school bags, backpacks, trolleys &amp; cabin luggage</strong></p><p>✔ Prevents <strong>lost luggage</strong> and helps identify bags quickly</p><p>✔ Perfect gift for <strong>travel lovers &amp; kids</strong><br><br>✔ Washable luggage tag</p><p>✔ Unbreakable tag for kids bags<br>&nbsp;</p>",
